	<div class="page-header">
		<h1>Gettjärnsklätten</h1>
	</div>

	<div class="prose">
		<p>
			A nature reserve on the road toward Gräsmark, where a cliff rises roughly 200 meters
			straight above Lake Rottnen — one of the best views in the whole valley. The reserve has
			been protected since 1976 for its unusual hazel-wood flora.
		</p>
		<p>
			Storm damage in 2025 left some deadfall along the trail, but the climb to the top is
			still doable if you don't mind stepping over a few fallen branches. In winter, the nearby
			lake "Lersjön" is a favorite for ice skating — see <a href="/activities/outdoors-water">Outdoors
			&amp; Water</a>.
		</p>
	</div>
</Layout>
